#: src/main.glade:423 src/onboarding.glade:111
msgid "Keyring / KWallet Auto-Unlock"
msgstr "Gantungan Kunci / KWallet Buka Kunci Otomatis"

#: src/main.glade:440
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring or "
"KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the TPM when "
"available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only master key. Face "
"auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwallet5 depending on "
"your desktop."
msgstr ""
"Aktifkan autentikasi wajah untuk membuka kunci kunci login Anda secara "
"otomatis atau KWallet saat login. Ini dengan aman menyimpan kata sandi Anda "
"yang disegel di TPM jika tersedia, atau dienkripsi dengan AES-256-GCM "
"menggunakan kunci master khusus root. Kumpulan autentikasi wajah PAM_AUTHTOK "
"untuk pam_gnome_keyring atau pam_kwallet5 bergantung pada desktop Anda."

#: src/main.glade:471
msgid "Current Status:"
msgstr "Status Saat Ini:"

#: src/main.glade:486
msgid "Checking..."
msgstr "Memeriksa..."

